{"unit_id":"PicGo__dsh-plugin#card-zh","repo":"PicGo/dsh-plugin","commit":"e553a91431487290ad66f3fd775a17775df738ce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@picgo/dsh-plugin 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的 PicGo 文件上传插件。它向 DSH 注册 picgo_upload 工具、/picgo 人工命令和辅助上传时机的技能，并在运行中的 PicGo 桌面应用与进程内 PicGo 库之间选择上传路由。主要功能包括上传本地图片或文件并返回公开链接、上传剪贴板图片、查看图床及登录状态、登录或退出 PicGo Cloud。适合需要把截图、图表或文档附件变成可分享链接的 DSH 用户；上传目标沿用 PicGo 当前配置，首次使用 PicGo Cloud 时需登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:111-185","src/command.ts:17-37","src/tool.ts:20-30","src/router.ts:49-75"]}
{"unit_id":"PicGo__dsh-plugin#card-en","repo":"PicGo/dsh-plugin","commit":"e553a91431487290ad66f3fd775a17775df738ce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@picgo/dsh-plugin connects DSH Web with PicGo, registering a file upload tool, /picgo command, and guidance skill. It uploads local files or clipboard images through the desktop app or PicGo library, returns hosted URLs, and supports checking host status and PicGo Cloud login.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:111-185","src/command.ts:17-37","src/tool.ts:20-30","src/router.ts:49-75"]}
